<title>USA: Most Unocal preferred tendered.</title>
<headline>Most Unocal preferred tendered.</headline>
<dateline>EL SEGUNDO, Calif. 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unocal Corp said Friday more than 90 percent of its outstanding $3.50 Convertible Preferred shares were tendered in response to the company's exchange offer which expired at 2400 EDT Thursday/0400 GMT Friday.</p>
<p>Unocal said it will acept all the validly tendered shares.</p>
<p>It said a preliminary count from Unocal's exchange agent, The Bank of New York, indicates that about 9.3 million shares have been validly tendered in exchange for new, 6-1/4 percent Trust Convertible Preferred Securities to be issued by Unocal Capital Trust.</p>
<p>Unocal said the exchange is expected to be completed on September 11.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
